From a5da92e9dc5e8c78893d0630de964d2ee568f392 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 17:17:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] fix(rfork): harden model loading and seed lifecycle

Restore Ascend MoE registrations and counters before fallback, prefer resolved checkpoint commits, and bypass RFork for static expert maps, sleep and online weight transfer. Guard later weight mutations and withdraw failed seed services without releasing live native registrations.

Restore checkpoint-layout transfers from seed manifests with additional derived tensors, validating their metadata while retaining strict required-weight and processed-layout checks. Document raw-byte, stride/view, NZ and checkpoint-stage design contracts and historical validation in English and Chinese. Planner code is unchanged.

Validation: 290 CPU-isolated tests passed, including real MLA post-load, real HTTP lifecycle and concurrent shutdown checks. Ruff, markdownlint, spelling, translation parsing and diff checks passed. Full vLLM worker and NPU/RDMA integration remain unverified.
Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 4ae54db0f167ec921dd6275ecc3b4fb48d4051d5)
