+
+msgid "Loading summaries are INFO on TP rank 0 of each group and DEBUG on other ranks. Their elapsed time covers that worker's loader call, including any failed RFork attempt, local fallback, and synchronous seed-service startup; it is not the maximum across ranks or time until the engine is ready, and does not wait for deferred seed promotion to finish. Set `VLLM_LOGGING_LEVEL=DEBUG` before startup to inspect per-rank initialization, layout, registration, metadata, read, lease release, and seed publication details. Normal deferred seed publication is DEBUG; failures remain WARNING/ERROR on every rank."
+msgstr "加载汇总在每组 TP rank 0 使用 INFO，其他 rank 使用 DEBUG。汇总耗时覆盖该 worker 的加载器调用，包括失败的 RFork 尝试、本地回退和同步 seed 服务启动；它不是跨 rank 最大耗时，也不是引擎就绪耗时，且不会等待延迟 seed 发布完成。启动前设置 `VLLM_LOGGING_LEVEL=DEBUG` 可查看各 rank 的初始化、布局处理、注册、元数据获取、读取、租约释放和 seed 发布细节。正常延迟发布 seed 使用 DEBUG，各 rank 的失败仍保留 WARNING/ERROR。"
+
+msgid "Fallback restores the Ascend MoE layer registry and layer counter, as well as the compilation registries and rotary cache, to their pre-attempt state. This releases discarded expert weights before checkpoint loading, including after partial model construction, while preserving an already loaded target model when a draft attempt fails."
+msgstr "回退会将 Ascend MoE 层注册表和层计数器，以及编译注册表和旋转位置编码缓存，恢复到本次尝试之前的状态。这确保在读取检查点之前释放已丢弃的专家权重，也覆盖模型构造中途失败的情况；草稿模型加载失败时，已加载的 target 模型会被保留。"
+
+msgid "Revision matching prefers the resolved checkpoint commit hash over a requested branch or tag such as `main`. Different commits therefore produce different fingerprints even when the requested revision is unchanged. If no commit hash is available, RFork uses the configured revision identifier; deployments using local checkpoints must supply an immutable model identity or deployment-strategy name when weights change. RFork does not hash local checkpoint contents."
+msgstr "版本匹配优先使用解析出的检查点 commit hash，而不是 `main` 等请求的分支或标签。因此，即使请求的 revision 未变，不同提交也会生成不同的指纹。如果没有可用的 commit hash，RFork 使用配置的版本标识；使用本地检查点的部署在权重变更时，必须提供对应的不可变模型标识或部署策略名。RFork 不计算本地检查点内容的哈希。"
+
+msgid "- Configuring a non-null `eplb_config.expert_map_path` also disables RFork, even when dynamic EPLB is off. Static expert placement is not covered by the compatibility fingerprint, so matching ranks and tensor shapes cannot establish compatibility. The main and draft models use the default loader directly, without creating RFork sessions, acquiring seed leases, registering transfer memory, or publishing seeds. No planner changes are required."
+msgstr "- 配置非空值（非 null）的 `eplb_config.expert_map_path` 也会禁用 RFork，即使动态 EPLB 已关闭。兼容性指纹未覆盖静态专家放置，因此 rank 和张量形状一致不足以证明兼容。主模型和草稿模型直接使用默认加载器，不创建 RFork session、不申请 seed 租约、不注册传输内存，也不发布 seed。无需修改 planner。"
+
+msgid "The session checks that its seed HTTP server thread is alive before each heartbeat and after each advertisement request. If the thread exits, RFork stops heartbeats and attempts to remove the advertisement; the loaded model can continue inference. Detection occurs on the next heartbeat, whose default interval is 30 seconds. Registered memory remains retained until normal cleanup because advertisement removal does not prove that existing native reads have finished. If removal fails, shutdown can retry and planner heartbeat expiry can reclaim the advertisement. This check detects thread exit, not a live but unresponsive HTTP server."
+msgstr "Session 在每次心跳前和每次发布请求后检查 seed HTTP 服务线程是否存活。线程退出时，RFork 停止心跳并尝试撤销发布，已加载模型可继续推理。退出会在下一次心跳时被发现，默认心跳间隔为 30 秒。已注册内存保留到正常清理流程，因为撤销发布不能证明已有原生读取已经结束。撤销失败时，shutdown 可以重试，planner 的心跳过期机制也可回收发布记录。此检查检测线程退出，不能检测线程仍存活但 HTTP 服务无响应的情况。"
+
+msgid "- RFork is bypassed when `model_config.enable_sleep_mode` is enabled or `weight_transfer_config` is configured. Target and draft models use the default loader without publishing seeds, so sleep and online weight updates can proceed normally. Configure these options before loading; RFork does not support draining and re-registering weights around runtime mutations."
+msgstr "- 启用 `model_config.enable_sleep_mode` 或配置 `weight_transfer_config` 时会跳过 RFork。主模型和草稿模型使用默认加载器且不发布 seed，因此 sleep 和在线权重更新可正常执行。请在加载前配置这些选项；RFork 尚不支持在运行时修改权重前等待所有读取结束、修改后重新注册权重的流程。"
+
+msgid "- A worker that has already created an RFork session rejects `sleep`, `start_weight_update`, `update_weights`, `finish_weight_update`, and `reload_weights` before modifying memory. This includes draft sessions and sessions retaining resources after failed cleanup. To use these operations, restart with `--load-format auto` for both target and draft, or configure sleep mode/online weight transfer before loading."
+msgstr "- 已创建 RFork session 的 worker 会在修改内存前拒绝 `sleep`、`start_weight_update`、`update_weights`、`finish_weight_update` 和 `reload_weights`。此限制也覆盖草稿模型 session，以及清理失败后仍保留资源的 session。若要使用这些操作，请为主模型和草稿模型均设置 `--load-format auto` 后重启，或在加载前配置 sleep 模式或在线权重传输。"
+
+msgid "### Tensor Layout Design"
+msgstr "### 张量布局设计"
+
+msgid "### Validation"
+msgstr "### 验证"
+
+msgid "Raw-byte transfer of the prepared tensor layout is intentional. RFork supports dense transposes and permutations without forcing every tensor to become contiguous. It can also adjust a receiver tensor to the seed shape with an in-place storage-preserving view when the element count matches. This preserves the historical quantized-model transfer design, which builds the inference layout before copying weights instead of repeating packing or transposition after transfer. Both instances must interpret the transferred bytes with the same effective layout; shape equality alone does not establish stride compatibility, and the manifest currently does not compare remote strides."
+msgstr "对准备好的张量布局直接进行原始字节传输是有意设计。RFork 支持稠密转置和维度排列，不强制将所有张量转为连续布局。元素数量一致时，也可通过保留底层存储的 view 将接收端张量调整为 seed 的形状。这延续了量化模型的既有传输设计：复制权重前先构造推理布局，避免传输后重复打包或转置。两端必须按相同的有效布局解释传输字节；仅形状一致不能证明 stride 兼容，当前 manifest 不比较远端 stride。"
+
+msgid "NZ transfer is also intentional: RFork copies prepared NPU tensors using `numel() * element_size()` bytes per tensor, rather than serializing checkpoint tensors or blindly copying entire allocator blocks. This relies on the target model's layout and alignment making that byte range sufficient for its physical representation. It is not a guarantee for arbitrary NZ tensors with padding. Validate physical layout, transfer coverage and inference accuracy on the intended NPU/model combination; CPU layout tests cannot establish NZ padding correctness."
+msgstr "NZ 传输同样是有意设计：RFork 对准备好的 NPU 张量按每个张量 `numel() * element_size()` 字节复制，不序列化检查点张量，也不直接复制整个分配器内存块。这依赖目标模型的布局和对齐保证该字节范围足以覆盖其物理表示，并不保证任意带 padding 的 NZ 张量均适用。应在目标 NPU 和模型组合上验证物理布局、传输覆盖范围和推理精度；CPU 布局测试不能证明 NZ padding 的正确性。"
+
+msgid "Checkpoint-layout transfer requires every non-shared local tensor to be present in the seed manifest, but allows the seed to contain additional tensors generated by post-load processing. Their metadata is validated and their bytes are not read. The receiver rebuilds required derived tensors during its normal post-load step; for example, unquantized MLA rebuilds `W_UV` and `W_UK_T` from the transferred `kv_b_proj.weight`. Processed-layout transfers still require matching final tensor inventories, apart from target-shared draft tensors. If the seed has disposed a checkpoint tensor still required by the receiver, RFork continues to fall back rather than performing an incomplete transfer."
+msgstr "Checkpoint-layout 传输要求 seed manifest 包含所有未与 target 共享的本地张量，但允许 seed 多出由加载后处理生成的张量。这些额外张量的元数据仍会校验，但不会读取其字节。接收端在正常加载后处理阶段重建所需派生张量，例如未量化 MLA 根据传输的 `kv_b_proj.weight` 重建 `W_UV` 和 `W_UK_T`。Processed-layout 传输仍要求最终张量清单一致，仅允许排除与 target 共享的草稿张量。如果 seed 已释放接收端仍需要的 checkpoint 张量，RFork 仍会回退，避免不完整传输。"
+
+msgid "### Historical Rationale and Validation"
+msgstr "### 历史设计依据与验证"
+
+msgid "RFork is a transfer path between compatible model instances, not a general-purpose tensor serializer. Its design preserves the model's established loading stages: prepare the receiver's inference layout before copying processed weights, or transfer the tensors required by the checkpoint path and then run the remaining post-load hooks. The transfer contract therefore depends on both the tensor representation and the loading stage."
+msgstr "RFork 是兼容模型实例之间的传输路径，并非通用张量序列化器。其设计保留了模型既有的加载阶段：复制处理后的权重前，先准备接收端的推理布局；或先传输 checkpoint 路径所需的张量，再执行剩余加载后处理。因此，传输约定同时取决于张量表示和加载阶段。"
+
+msgid "Allowing a seed superset in the checkpoint path is an intentional stage-dependent contract. The seed has completed loading, while the receiver has not yet created all derived tensors; requiring identical inventories at this point would reject a valid source. The local inventory determines the bytes that must be transferred. Every required local entry must match the seed's dtype, element count and element size, while the existing shape/view rules still apply. Seed-only entries never supply substitute data for a missing local weight. In the processed-layout path, both sides have already prepared their final tensors, so the stricter inventory check remains appropriate."
+msgstr "允许 checkpoint 路径的 seed 清单为接收端清单的超集，是有意设计的阶段相关约定。Seed 已完成加载，而接收端尚未创建全部派生张量；此时要求清单完全相同，会拒绝有效数据源。本地清单决定必须传输的字节。每个必需本地条目的 dtype、元素数量和元素大小都必须与 seed 匹配，同时继续遵循既有 shape/view 规则。仅 seed 存在的条目不能替代缺失的本地权重。Processed-layout 路径中，两端均已准备好最终张量，因此仍适用更严格的清单检查。"
+
